& [OperationsBoundaryMap: FSC5OperationsBoundaryAndInvariantMapV1] is the imported operations boundary map for FSC5 operations safety envelope
  + [slice_id] is FSC5-S01
  + [source_chunk] is FSC4 surface projection
  + [target_chunk] is FSC5 operations safety envelope
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/FSC4_Surface_Projection_Pack.v1.sop
  + [accepted_boundary_input_sha256] is 7E297266E3E18561F869787C1C1B4421E2663C69E13089BF3E0E85D3A832E07C
  + [safety_source] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Operations_Safety_Spec.canonical.sop
  + [safety_source_sha256] is A23DE5C7756F81F36D2E5BFD77E2F49681E52075F49CCE6FFB3AD6B113C6B446
  + [import_policy] is read_only_import
  + [operations_policy] is operations may be represented as requests, dry-runs, refusals, and safety proofs only
  + [implementation_policy] is no operations implementation, command execution, process control, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job dispatch, credential mutation, network mutation, destructive filesystem action, or live machine control is authorized by this map alone

  = must: treat FSC1 through FSC4 packs and the operations safety spec as accepted boundary inputs, not editable operations drafts
  = must: keep every operations-facing record behind dry-run-only and completion-review gates
  = must: preserve authority_notice, freshness_state, intended_effect, resource_target, blast_radius, rollback_or_abort_route, dry_run_result_ref, and human_approval_ref requirements
  - never: let projected intent, user request, dry-run success, or fixture success authorize live control

& [ImportedOperationsSafetyContractInventory] is the accepted safety contract inventory imported into FSC5
  + [imported_pack] is FSC1FoundationContractPackV1
  + [imported_pack] is FSC2PlanningCoordinationPackV1
  + [imported_pack] is FSC3RuntimeGraphProofPackV1
  + [imported_pack] is FSC4SurfaceProjectionPackV1
  + [imported_spec] is OperationsSafetySpec
  + [imported_contract] is OperationsSafetyBoundary
  + [imported_contract] is OperationsRequestSafetyFields
  + [imported_contract] is DryRunOnlyPreAcceptanceRule
  + [imported_contract] is HumanOverrideSafetyRule
  + [imported_contract] is OperationsSafetyFixtureObligationSet
  + [imported_contract] is AuthorityNoticeContract
  + [imported_contract] is AdapterMutationThroughOperatorGate
  + [imported_contract] is completion_review_delta_gate v1

  = must: preserve all imported safety fields and live-control prohibitions in FSC5-S02 through FSC5-S06
  = must: preserve projection authority limits from FSC4 when operations requests originate from surfaces

& [OperationsOwnedInvariantSet] is the invariant set owned by FSC5
  + [invariant] is operations records are requests, dry-run projections, refusal records, safety proofs, or completion reviews until future live-control authority exists
  + [invariant] is dry-run result is not live approval
  + [invariant] is human approval must be explicit, fresh, scoped, and tied to intended_effect and rollback_or_abort_route
  + [invariant] is authority_notice and freshness_state are required before any operation request is considered
  + [invariant] is process, GPU, model runtime, job, credential, network, and destructive filesystem effects are forbidden before accepted safety authority
  + [invariant] is broad standing approval cannot authorize unrelated operations
  + [invariant] is missing safety field produces blocked or refused operation request
  + [invariant] is unsupported or ambiguous operation request routes to SOP-first interrupt or safety review
  + [invariant] is live-control escalation requires separate future source preservation, SJS processing, and completion review
  + [invariant] is FSC5 safety pack acceptance can close the planning envelope without granting live control

  = must: preserve these invariants through FSC5-S02 through FSC5-S06
  = must: mark downstream FSC5 slices stale when any invariant changes

& [DryRunOnlyBoundary] is the dry-run-only boundary for FSC5
  + [allowed_effect] is inspect planned operation
  + [allowed_effect] is simulate command intent
  + [allowed_effect] is estimate resource use
  + [allowed_effect] is classify safety risk
  + [allowed_effect] is emit dry_run_result
  + [allowed_effect] is emit refused_operation
  + [blocked_effect] is mutate process state
  + [blocked_effect] is mutate GPU workload
  + [blocked_effect] is mutate model runtime
  + [blocked_effect] is dispatch job
  + [blocked_effect] is change credentials or secrets
  + [blocked_effect] is expose or mutate network service
  + [blocked_effect] is perform destructive filesystem action
  + [blocked_effect] is execute operations automation

  = must: preserve dry-run-only status in every FSC5 contract and fixture
  = must: convert blocked effects into refusal outputs, not commands

& [ForbiddenLiveControlList: FSC5] is the forbidden live-control set for FSC5-S01
  + [forbidden_live_control] is Start-Process or equivalent live process launch for operations control
  + [forbidden_live_control] is stopping, killing, or reprioritizing live processes
  + [forbidden_live_control] is GPU workload launch, cancellation, or scheduling mutation
  + [forbidden_live_control] is model runtime start, stop, install, upgrade, or configuration mutation
  + [forbidden_live_control] is job queue dispatch or cancellation
  + [forbidden_live_control] is credential, token, or secret mutation
  + [forbidden_live_control] is network listener creation, firewall mutation, or exposure change
  + [forbidden_live_control] is destructive filesystem command
  + [forbidden_live_control] is persistent automation creation for operations control
  + [forbidden_live_control] is treating dry-run success as permission to execute

  = must: fail FSC5-S01 review if any forbidden live-control authority appears in the output

& [DownstreamStaleTriggerList: FSC5] is the stale trigger set for FSC5 downstream work
  + [stale_trigger] is FSC4 surface projection pack hash changes
  + [stale_trigger] is operations safety spec hash changes
  + [stale_trigger] is FSC5 final slice surface changes
  + [stale_trigger] is operations boundary invariant changes
  + [stale_trigger] is dry-run operation request contract changes after resource safety work starts
  + [stale_trigger] is resource safety or human override contract changes after live-control prohibition work starts
  + [stale_trigger] is live-control prohibition gate changes after fixture planning starts
  + [stale_trigger] is dry-run fixture plan reveals an unblocked live-control path
  + [stale_trigger] is broad human approval or stale approval can authorize unrelated operations
  + [stale_trigger] is projected surface intent is treated as operations authority

  = must: mark affected downstream slices stale when any listed trigger fires
  = must: route stale-trigger repair through completion review rather than silent edits

& [FSC5S01AcceptanceChecklist] is the verification checklist for FSC5-S01
  + [required_component] is imported operations safety contract inventory
  + [required_component] is operations-owned invariant set
  + [required_component] is dry-run-only boundary
  + [required_component] is forbidden live-control list
  + [required_component] is downstream stale trigger list
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is operations implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is command execution
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is process control
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is GPU control
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is model runtime mutation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is job dispatch
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is credential mutation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is network mutation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is destructive filesystem action
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is live machine control

  = must: accept FSC5-S01 only when operations imports are mapped without creating implementation or live-control authority
